<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Orion Electric 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Orion Electric 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		     1,071    vs     1,406</p>
<p>    Net				  16.8  vs	  21.4</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   21.2  vs	  26.9</p>
<p>Dividend</p>
<p>	cash (pct, par 5,000 won)   4    vs	   2</p>
<p>	stock (pct)		     2    vs	   3</p>
<p>    Turnover			  904.2  vs	 751.2</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  (loss) 0.98 vs  (gain) 0.08</p>
<p>    Div pay			    April 10</p>
<p>NOTE - Orion Electric Co Ltd, a unit of Daewoo Group, said its share capital rose to 15.69 million shares from 15.25 million due to dividend payments in stocks.</p>
<p>-- Seoul newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
